fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/GstAnalyticsModelInfo.html#gst_analytics_modelinfo_load","fragment":"\n\tgst_analytics_modelinfo_load\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.prototype.load\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.load\n\nLoad a modelinfo file associated with the given model file.\nThis function attempts to load a .modelinfo file in the following order:\nThe modelinfo file contains metadata for the model's input and output tensors,\nincluding normalization ranges, dimension ordering, tensor IDs, etc.\nThe loaded modelinfo must be freed with gst_analytics_modelinfo_free\nwhen no longer needed.\nParameters:\nPath to the model file (e.g., \"model.onnx\", \"model.tflite\")\nA new GstAnalyticsModelInfo instance,\nor NULL if the modelinfo file could not be found or loaded.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nLoad a modelinfo file associated with the given model file.\nThis function attempts to load a .modelinfo file in the following order:\nThe modelinfo file contains metadata for the model's input and output tensors,\nincluding normalization ranges, dimension ordering, tensor IDs, etc.\nThe loaded modelinfo must be freed with GstAnalytics.ModelInfo.prototype.free\nwhen no longer needed.\nParameters:\nPath to the model file (e.g., \"model.onnx\", \"model.tflite\")\nA new GstAnalytics.ModelInfo instance,\nor null if the modelinfo file could not be found or loaded.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nLoad a modelinfo file associated with the given model file.\nThis function attempts to load a .modelinfo file in the following order:\nThe modelinfo file contains metadata for the model's input and output tensors,\nincluding normalization ranges, dimension ordering, tensor IDs, etc.\nThe loaded modelinfo must be freed with GstAnalytics.ModelInfo.free\nwhen no longer needed.\nParameters:\nPath to the model file (e.g., \"model.onnx\", \"model.tflite\")\nA new GstAnalytics.ModelInfo instance,\nor None if the modelinfo file could not be found or loaded.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});